&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://assets.wp.lanes-planes.com/app/uploads/2025/12/Posting-header-banner.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;styles-module__fieldItemName___s-uMO&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Love numbers? Want everything to run like a well-oiled machine without losing sight of the big picture? In this versatile role, you’ll not only own all analytics around our GMV reporting, but also play a key part in shaping the underlying processes and data flows. You’ll have plenty of room to actively build and develop an important area of Finance and to drive critical change. Working closely with Finance Leadership, you’ll lead your own team and help shape sustainable processes and automation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles-module__fieldItemName___s-uMO&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles-module__fieldItemName___s-uMO&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech infrastructure and process design:&lt;/strong&gt; You ensure a high-performance analytics infrastructure to manage our rapidly growing travel volume (GMV) reliably, efficiently and at scale. A large part of your work will focus on making existing workflows more efficient and acting as a driver for lasting change: designing and steering projects for continuous process improvement and targeted (AI) automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
