&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify performance gaps and build action plans to address them at the individual and team level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gather and synthesize market intelligence to inform team positioning and opportunity prioritization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent NinjaOne at trade events and support team members in key client meetings, training, and onboarding&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally to surface insights, flag risks, and escalate opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other duties as needed&lt;/p&gt;
