&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://poly.ai?utm_source=prnewswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=pressrelease&amp;amp;utm_campaign=boilerplate&amp;amp;utm_content=pressrelease&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;PolyAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is the Agentic Dialog Platform for building the conversational enterprise, used to build, run, govern, and improve dialog agents at scale. Powered by Raven, a proprietary dialog model trained on more than a billion enterprise conversations, PolyAI agents are built for complexity, open at every layer, and sovereign by design. PolyAI serves hundreds of enterprises across 75 languages and 25 countries, including Metro Bank, Marriott, PG&amp;amp;E, and UniCredit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;PolyAI is hiring a Senior Manager, EMEA Marketing to help own our marketing strategy and pipeline contribution across the EMEA region. You will build and run EMEA marketing, with a focus on pipeline and PLG-to-sales handoff. You will focus on field events, campaigns and webinars that build awareness and demand among enterprise buyers and developers in EMEA, and set the regional marketing plan with Sales, Partnerships and the global Marketing team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This role suits a hands-on marketer who has helped a platform or developer-led business move from product-led growth (PLG) to a sales-led (SLG) motion. You will adapt global programs to local markets, report on regional results to senior leadership, and coach the people and agencies who deliver the work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll own and be measured on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;EMEA-sourced pipeline against target&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;The UK/I and DACH marketing plans, including priorities by country and segment, agreed with regional Sales leadership&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;The events program: strategic, partner and field events, from strategy through to on-site execution&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Growing our international database&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;The PLG-to-SLG handoff with local BDRs, including lead routing, follow-up plays and shared reporting&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Reporting on cost per outcome, conversion and ROI, and adjusting the plan using the data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll influence, working with our central marketing teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Financial Services and Healthcare plays in EMEA (with Product Marketing)&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Customer evidence and logos for the region&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;PR, comms and regional stories&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Launches, sales assets and localization (with Product Marketing, Design and Brand)&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Campaigns, events and combined motions in EMEA (with Demand Generation)&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;4-6 years in B2B marketing, including field marketing, events and campaigns, with recent regional or EMEA ownership&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;A record of building a regional marketing plan from scratch and meeting a pipeline target, with results you can quantify&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Experience marketing a platform, developer or technical product, and helping move a business from product-led growth (PLG) to a sales-led (SLG) motion&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Experience working with BDRs/SDRs and sales leaders on lead quality, routing and attribution, including influencing them without owning them, and the confidence to push back on sales and channel requests when priorities need to be set&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Working knowledge of EMEA markets, including cultural, language and regulatory differences (for example GDPR)&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Strong partnership skills: you get what you need from central teams through clear asks and shared plans&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Experience with Salesforce and a marketing automation platform&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Clear, collaborative communication with senior executives and technical audiences&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;sub&gt;Willingness to travel for in-person events&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We offer a competitive base salary, shaped by your experience and location, plus equity — so you share in the value you help create.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
