&lt;li&gt;Own and execute full sales cycles, from prospecting to deal close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain an accurate, healthy pipeline against territory/quota targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key decision-makers and navigate procurement processes within large internal IT organizations&lt;/li&gt;
