&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop proposal and/or presentation of recommended solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
